$y=8x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399384 1072 #uuid "ed5c021d-75c0-5eb0-8447-cc8817c3eb31" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399384 1074 "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $y=8x,$ we first replace $y$ with $8x$ in the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-\\frac{(8x)^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-\\frac{64{x}^{2}}{16} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-4{x}^{2} & =1 \\\\ -3{x}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe cannot take the square root of a negative number. Therefore, the equation has no real solutions. So, the hyperbola does not intersect the line $y=8x.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399386 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399387 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399388 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399389 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399390 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399386 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399385 1080 #uuid "a6c46fcc-9e01-5325-b5ea-b258368147e8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399386 1081 "There are no points of intersection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399386 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399386 1084 #uuid "295a34e6-e842-585f-b03d-2b207719a6a2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399387 1081 "x=\\pm 3" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399387 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399387 1084 #uuid "3eac3404-fcdd-511d-b564-54a6a260657f" 13194139533478