∗ & k+3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe minor of ${a}_{22}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}2k & 6 \\\\ 11 & k+3\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}2k & 6 \\\\ 11 & k+3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2k\\cdot (k+3)-11\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =2{k}^{2}+6k-66.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of ${a}_{22}$ is $-70$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{k}^{2}+6k-66 & =-70 \\\\ 2{k}^{2}+6k+4 & =0 \\\\ {k}^{2}+3k+2 & =0 \\\\ (k+1)(k+2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=-1$ and $k=-2.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399474 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399475 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399476 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399477 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399478 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399474 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399473 1080 #uuid "4e6e33e7-dd66-569c-9ddd-b087772632c9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399474 1081 "$k=-1$ and $k=-2$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399474 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399474 1084 #uuid "9b9eaaa1-9a11-5e97-894b-033fdcba3183" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399475 1081 "$k=1$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399475 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399475 1084 #uuid "13957928-5c88-587e-8787-1039aba9a145" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1081 "$k=-2$ only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399476 1084 #uui