 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1071 "The position $s(t)$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by \n\n$$\ns(t)={t}^{2}-2t+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,t>0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the velocity at time $t=3.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1072 #uuid "3df15b1d-5c6a-5a31-88c3-94f27234c33f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399603 1074 "First, we calculate the velocity function by differentiating the position function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}-2t+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t) \\\\  & =2t-2+\\frac{1}{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo calculate the velocity at $t=3,$ we substitute $t=3$ into the velocity function above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(3) & =2(3)-2+\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =6-2+\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{13}{3} \\\\  & =4.333\\,333… \\\\  & ≈4.33\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399605 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399606 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399607 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399608 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399609 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399607 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399604 1080 #uuid "2dc005a4-0a0a-5369-9aa9-e0229fc91626" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1081 "v=6.67" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399605 1084 #uuid "9733cf69-5d70-514e-a80d-eadad1d41489" 13194139533478 1759