x-8)+⋯ \\\\  & =2+\\frac{x-8}{12}+⋯.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute $x=7$ into the above to approximate ${7}^{1/3}.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{1/3} & ≈2+\\frac{7-8}{12} \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{12} \\\\  & =\\frac{23}{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399612 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399613 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399614 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399615 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399616 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399616 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399611 1080 #uuid "6c042d42-f6d6-52fa-992c-350b4e969301" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399612 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399612 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399612 1084 #uuid "d1d3691b-a1a5-5e81-bfe2-760939975d1d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399613 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{25}{12}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399613 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399613 1084 #uuid "7ebae067-1d98-5398-842f-52e5beff87e6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399614 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{4}{3}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399614 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399614 1084 #uuid "1270a921-f7ad-5051-be4e-3a8d359de937" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399615 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399615 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399615 1084 #uuid "83d51c96-b38e-5a00-a86c-b8ab59d290d0" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399616 1081 "{7}^{1/3}≈\\frac{23}{12}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399616 1084 #uuid "dcada4a4-8b8c-5274-9b06-9d7f2171686e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399618 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1069 "q-20362" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1072 #uuid "b5cb76d6-8596-56c0-bf91-5764390c6dbb" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399617 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399619 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399620 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399621 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399622 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399623 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399621 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399618 1080 #uuid "a8af118b-89c1-56df-aee8-e8ea929b9eb7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399619 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y-2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399619 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399619 1084 #uuid "7ddbc91f-a2bc-5c20-979a-ce7e906dc06d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399620 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x-2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399620 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399620 1084 #uuid "ca1394d8-a03f-5e29-aaba-bb0176d8f59b" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399621 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399621 1084 #uuid "9761f4c8-5981-5fd5-88ce-d6d56601691c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399622 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ x+2y+3z=2 \\\\ 4x+3y+z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399622 1084 #uuid "13919b67-24a3-5f25-90aa-a16013b5b7e6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399623 1081 "{\\begin{aligned}2x+y+2z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+3z=-2 \\\\ x+3y+4z=3\\end{aligned}" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399623 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399623 1084 #uuid "2f7be1b8-6206-50f4-9b88-856c8d8e718a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399625 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1069 "q-20851" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1071 "For the parametric curve \n\n$$\nx=2\\sqrt{t},\\,y=12t+1,\\,0\\le t<\\infty ,\n$$\n\n find the derivative $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at the point $P$ on the curve where $t=1.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1072 #uuid "a11f695c-004e-57f4-b1f5-cd09434f69e2" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399624 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating $x$ and $y,$ we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,{y}^{′}(t)=12.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}}=12\\sqrt{t}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=1$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dy}{dx} & =12\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & =12\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399626 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399627 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399628 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399629 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399630 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399626 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399625 1080 #uuid "0ec6f4c2-cef2-5136-bda0-046075ea56a5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399626 1081 "12" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399626 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399626 1084 #uuid "1e5ec4eb-fb50-5d50-87c7-e15a073c23f5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399627 1081 "10" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399627 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399627 1084 #uuid "7b15bc55-e6d8-5c21-b55e-568e588591b8" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399628 1081 "3" 13194139533